      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استنسأهُ</span></b>  <i>He asked him to postpone</i> or <i>to
grant him a delay in, the payment of his debt.</i>
(S, K.) [See also 1.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استنسأهُ البَيْعَ</span> <i>He
asked him to make the sale to be on credit,</i> or <i>for
payment at a future period.</i> (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استنسأ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَرِيمَهُ</span> <i>He asked his creditor to grant him a delay
in the payment of his debt.</i> (A.)

